{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaayvurenda/bubble

    What a character says: its initial (its picture, later), its name and its words.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * initial - the first letter of its name, while it has no picture
    * role - memory or herald
    * name - the character's name
    * text - what it says

    Example context (json):
    {
        "initial": "M",
        "role": "memory",
        "name": "Memoria",
        "text": "He buscado por toda la biblioteca."
    }
}}
<div class="ayv-bubble">
    <span class="ayv-bubble-portrait ayv-bubble-{{role}}" aria-hidden="true">{{initial}}</span>
    <p class="ayv-bubble-text"><span class="ayv-bubble-name">{{name}}</span> {{text}}</p>
</div>
